0 L-10 ILLEGAL: a PLATE wedged edge-on into the channel between two stud rows.
0 The 8 LDU clear gap between adjacent studs is exactly a plate's thickness, so
0 it goes in -- and grips on its two smooth faces against the stud walls, a
0 friction fit the System does not intend. Contrast G-01: identical geometry
0 with a tile, which is legal.
